      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WYNDRA ALL PRADA (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and two minors from six tries. Placed last time (23.77) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing second and beaten a nose. Looks suited here and rates on top. HUDSON RIVERLINE (1) was well supported last time but could only manage second (23.80), beaten a neck. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. VANILLA SLICE (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.87) at this track behind Mr. Williams in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Expected to be in the finish again. FARMOR SENIOR (4) is hard to fault of late and is a strong top-three hope again.",
